<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Oct producer/import prices down 2.5 pct yr/y.</title>
<headline>Swiss Oct producer/import prices down 2.5 pct yr/y.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The combined index for Swiss producer and import prices fell 2.5 percent in October from a year earlier, the Federal Statistics Office said.  </p>
<p>				   Oct 1996   Sept 1996   Oct 1995</p>
<p>Monthly pct index change   + 0.1	  + 0.2	 - 0.4</p>
<p>Yr/yr pct index change     - 2.5	  - 3.0	 - 0.6</p>
<p>Index (100 = May 1993)	96.8	   96.7	  99.3</p>
<p>Note - The combined producer/import price index replaced the wholesale price index in May 1993.</p>
</text>
